{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/lq69tr3ip84kcz6o9ybding6343rfhh.mp3","text":"呵呵，博士，你运气不错，我今天没什么事要做，可以陪你一会儿。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/31fdqletct63uvqk2n5m2z3c2cn0b8s.mp3","text":"龙门的市井，乌萨斯的郊区，维多利亚的古废墟......博士，这个世界上有无数美景，只不过，很少有人去发现。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/3k3ddsu0kajyjudsvmno8yd0ha5fzet.mp3","text":"博士，想听我旅途中发生的故事吗？那么，我建议你准备一些美味的茶点，不然，再精彩的故事也会变得乏味的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/qjywr78r1kbwrqhf4pr37w1kufjz9ww.mp3","text":"即使我曾观察过无数不同的团体，罗德岛的有趣程度也是数一数二的。究竟是时代将为你们倾倒，还是你们终被时代吞没......我很好奇。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/n0zp7ju6c03t8no30ncx80rt948ni1c.mp3","text":"博士，关于下一个任务地点，我有一些很不错的美食推荐，想听吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/ga6fpcy9tqbw30gfu9h97itvshqlasl.mp3","text":"博士，你似乎已经了解了何为堕天使，不过很遗憾，我不会告诉你详细。即使有一天我能与你分享我的一切，这也会是我唯一的秘密吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/rktf8er00f832wty0si5bigapjp6mi6.mp3","text":"博士，你不用去考虑如何和我打好关系，对我来说，友情、亲情、爱情，我不讨厌，但并不需要......不过，呵呵，即使我这么说，你也不会放弃吧，没关系，你可以尝试，我不会介意的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/78t5dzwpbsxrjzdi11n26rxs67ct1vx.mp3","text":"我回来......嗯？博士，难道你在等我吗？而且茶几上的这些点心......好吧，这可真是盛情难却呢，那么作为谢礼，我就为你讲一讲，在这次送货中，发生了什么有趣的事吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/2gj6pl5m5m2yrbq7i6r3wm7y4bi3fjn.mp3","text":"......原来如此，当我想到有你这样一个朋友时，那股油然而生的喜悦并不虚假。收回前言，博士。或许，我并不是不需要这样的温暖。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/j9wqo3ru18xrwrdmhwvk6vk0tyvzhz1.mp3","text":"......呵呵，祝你好梦，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/noeogv2i4ebuxld40g0ar0zw5glevx6.mp3","text":"你好，博士，我是莫斯提马。你应该听大帝说过，我不受罗德岛与企鹅物流的合约约束，可以自由行动。不过，闲时我也会在罗德岛逗留。那么，请多指教。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/d1i7fyemhdf6zb47375ha7b50ga411d.mp3","text":"就让我看看，罗德岛的作战方式吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/cojetrtwtccax54ffv5q2fcah3n52pj.mp3","text":"博士，依赖我可不是一个好选择。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/kzajmp8dw7fqvih77yq3yvre1t28alc.mp3","text":"博士，听说你想看我使出全力。保险起见，我先问一句——我不用去在乎赔偿问题吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/69cfvpjbz8cl59894dl3hsnd4kq72as.mp3","text":"来了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/a3u7l4a6cl8d6vs3xthae8dto7emo7x.mp3","text":"嗯......抱歉，可以让大家自由行动吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/hnw0t1nubnarv9ysgt4f5suiegokt9m.mp3","text":"这个地方的话......我来带路吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/guyegtr2qrnpske2a3lrdlye7b59aw4.mp3","text":"速战速决吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/56g03wulzgqlp3x535u662123acw7g3.mp3","text":"嗯哼？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/j7tk3rdd47rygrvvjyw0vj3lroguqi9.mp3","text":"呵呵......","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/a76qbcfijwa5nj9la5ta34kizp3jzma.mp3","text":"天气不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/r7rg5q3vzanjqqsmgkq4gxpn89xogek.mp3","text":"风景不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/h7rtapp3ifatwywi4u0ipo79h09dc1y.mp3","text":"七分力应该差不多了吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/61/4ipl3xcn67huwzrotg7fra3m8uju48c.mp3","text":"差不多该结束了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/cwp7qujp4hgyyssmrpnidshtuqsg9q8.mp3","text":"虽说无冤无仇，不过这就是生活呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/fo53to80wp7ffw64tja1z6cj96uh1h7.mp3","text":"结束后吃点什么好呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/5illihi83atcr1qjj58cu4qzw49ovqt.mp3","text":"偶尔追求一些刺激，也是不坏的选择。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/mg2uxnqwd9joi9wdi8j2udsb68i8jln.mp3","text":"嗯？我还以为会漏掉几个。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/7ga21bzmu9rg3i6vxdvd61dqbha2ujp.mp3","text":"信使一般不会关注战斗的结果，只要活着，就是胜利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/dlxumeeky2z8dfpon359iv119bir5lm.mp3","text":"团队协作......对我来说果然还是有些陌生啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/7zbagmn9qqqe228ngy3cgp4zz8dn9tl.mp3","text":"我可以四处逛逛吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/m7jxelxm5ajq3eoy79bdwouq5taalbx.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/h48sknbqo7142owbdbzx1efpey2ui0f.mp3","text":"来聊聊天吧，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/ejovq5xxaqi4zr03zevd7ocpuio0qtx.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/sod30hgee67p0eyty79x7olwq1qa0f0.mp3","text":"以前，这个日子对我来说和平时别无二致，不会过多停留的地方，不打算深交的人，他们所有的热闹......都与我无关。我从没想过我也会有体会到节日氛围的一天，这感觉不坏。新年快乐，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/az5wu81wlan6o8r76pmi80yyqdvn9i1.mp3","text":"博士，今天过得好吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_213_mostma/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/jwp1c67b3d7kxxyotsw9vx9i8ui65ix.mp3","text":"呵呵，博士，你运气不错，我今天没什么事要做，可以陪你一会儿。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/oztt1tav303wcjyiws2dffrlmwo3oqh.mp3","text":"龙门的市井，乌萨斯的郊区，维多利亚的古废墟......博士，这个世界上有无数美景，只不过，很少有人去发现。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/ly9qb7h7z7qgrksm39orj4uqfcrt99q.mp3","text":"博士，想听我旅途中发生的故事吗？那么，我建议你准备一些美味的茶点，不然，再精彩的故事也会变得乏味的。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/gf0ebjwwi7iqh7qywkndqo8q6hsm837.mp3","text":"即使我曾观察过无数不同的团体，罗德岛的有趣程度也是数一数二的。究竟是时代将为你们倾倒，还是你们终被时代吞没......我很好奇。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/heujeoqqrjybgnrbb1nwdyq88d4er96.mp3","text":"博士，关于下一个任务地点，我有一些很不错的美食推荐，想听吗？","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/t19k99svw4e4xwwcp4tghncmxj6q8er.mp3","text":"博士，你似乎已经了解了何为堕天使，不过很遗憾，我不会告诉你详细。即使有一天我能与你分享我的一切，这也会是我唯一的秘密吧。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/gs2im39dt0rxpt6smj6csgx0ceatv9x.mp3","text":"博士，你不用去考虑如何和我打好关系，对我来说，友情、亲情、爱情，我不讨厌，但并不需要......不过，呵呵，即使我这么说，你也不会放弃吧，没关系，你可以尝试，我不会介意的。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/49r3fql5vfgbbzm1y26bhasemqb0eyf.mp3","text":"我回来......嗯？博士，难道你在等我吗？而且茶几上的这些点心......好吧，这可真是盛情难却呢，那么作为谢礼，我就为你讲一讲，在这次送货中，发生了什么有趣的事吧。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/sq9o0dxfz1b3ra7bwe5hlu2rfyc3844.mp3","text":"......原来如此，当我想到有你这样一个朋友时，那股油然而生的喜悦并不虚假。收回前言，博士。或许，我并不是不需要这样的温暖。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/p7ye6udeej2flzvcoy17yyythcdd7o2.mp3","text":"......呵呵，祝你好梦，博士。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/8jij3bx8hw3ki73e7r9cnm997w96l8e.mp3","text":"你好，博士，我是莫斯提马。你应该听大帝说过，我不受罗德岛与企鹅物流的合约约束，可以自由行动。不过，闲时我也会在罗德岛逗留。那么，请多指教。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/cpanbset8e44wct7c6863avr0rfdfnd.mp3","text":"就让我看看，罗德岛的作战方式吧。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/pqs9uptu7bjrf583av93wwekiyo5pc5.mp3","text":"博士，依赖我可不是一个好选择。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/sjqu2fk7xm9jqmpulcvlu326iz3nujb.mp3","text":"博士，听说你想看我使出全力。保险起见，我先问一句——我不用去在乎赔偿问题吧？","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/6i8h3lyutsrnacvxm57cycuus4stun9.mp3","text":"来了。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/fq95q984ckeddxigeyqy2b5i9orbb4y.mp3","text":"嗯......抱歉，可以让大家自由行动吗？","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/mjl42ibmu7xfscajem9mehn6zv0r507.mp3","text":"这个地方的话......我来带路吧。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/cwzjyae1qe032fzr73exmc614enq6qd.mp3","text":"速战速决吧。","alt":"voice/char_213_mostma/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki: